find - search files by their name
grep - search inside for text
        grep "<text>" <file>
& - Run the command but do not prevent further work before
    it finished. Runs in background
&& - Runs multiple commands sequentially
        <command 1> && <command 2>
> - Redirect output and send it to a file, overwriting the
    file
>> - Redirector does same thing but appends it to the bottom
    of the file
touch - creates a file
mkdir - creates a directory
cp - copy file/folder
mv - move file/folder
rm - remove file/folder